# Short aliases into the Studio application. The root and /index.html are NOT
# redirected: they serve the public marketing page, which is the entry point for
# everyone who has not bought yet. Rules sending them to /studio/ predated that
# page and would have carried every visitor straight past it.
/app        /studio/            301
/app/*      /studio/:splat      301
/voice      /studio/voice.html  302
